after submission by ticket 0727. Read the PR page for maintainer response and
CI, make requested changes on the fork branch, and record the upstream outcome.
`SYNC.md` owns the live status; this ticket owns the work and its evidence.

## Remaining verification from 0727

- Run Remove → install replacement through a real Zotero Add-ons window, with
  the pending removal present, and observe whether the new add-on survives.
- Run the control: a genuinely pending removal still completes when the window
  closes. The submitted module test passed; the real UI path has not run.
